h3 2.7 Safe passing of structured data @17,591,694,19
text To support passing JavaScript objects, including , across  boundaries, this specification defines the following infrastructure for serializing and deserializing objects, including in some cases transferring the underlying data instead of copying it. Collectively this serialization/deserialization process is known as "structured cloning", although most APIs perform separate serialization and deserialization steps. (With the notable exception being the  method.) @17,622,694,101
